    <node id="&quot;ANNA HENKEL-GRÖNEMEYER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anna Henkel-Grönemeyer is a talented actress and renowned singer, musician, and actor, known for her performances in German films and television shows, and her enduring marriage to Herbert Grönemeyer."</data>
